# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install the C API for the latest version of Qiskit Fermions"
msgstr "I-install ang C API para sa pinakabagong bersyon ng Qiskit Fermions"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install the C API"
msgstr "I-install ang C API"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install the C API {#install-the-c-api}"
msgstr "I-install ang C API {#install-the-c-api}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prerequisites {#prerequisites}"
msgstr "Mga kinakailangan {#prerequisites}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Before getting started, you must ensure that you have installed the [Rust toolchain](https://www.rust-lang.org/tools/install) as well as the [clang compiler](https://clang.llvm.org/).\n"
msgstr "Bago magsimula, tiyaking naka-install ang [Rust toolchain](https://www.rust-lang.org/tools/install) pati ang [clang compiler](https://clang.llvm.org/).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Now, clone the `qiskit-fermions` repository.\n"
msgstr "Ngayon, i-clone ang repository ng `qiskit-fermions`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Next, you must also compile the Qiskit C API. You can do this in any location, but to get started quickly, follow these steps:\n"
msgstr "Susunod, kailangan mo ring i-compile ang Qiskit C API. Magagawa mo ito sa anumang lokasyon, pero para mabilis na makapagsimula, sundin ang mga hakbang na ito:\n"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<DoqAdmonition type=\"note\" title=\"Hint\">\n"
msgstr "<DoqAdmonition type=\"note\" title=\"Hint\">\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  On **Windows** only, you need to copy additional library files:\n"
msgstr "  Sa **Windows** lang, kailangan mong kopyahin ang karagdagang mga library file:\n"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  <Tabs group=\"tab\">\n"
"<TabItem value=\"windows\" label=\"Windows\">\n"
msgstr ""
"  <Tabs group=\"tab\">\n"
"<TabItem value=\"windows\" label=\"Windows\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"</TabItem>\n"
"  </Tabs>\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "</DoqAdmonition>\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Now you can follow the steps in the next section to compile the `qiskit-fermions` C API.\n"
msgstr "Ngayon ay maaari mo nang sundin ang mga hakbang sa susunod na seksyon para i-compile ang C API ng `qiskit-fermions`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Compile from source {#compile-from-source}"
msgstr "I-compile mula sa source {#compile-from-source}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To get started, configure your shell environment with the locations of your compiled Qiskit C API library and include directory.\n"
msgstr "Para makapagsimula, i-configure ang iyong shell environment gamit ang mga lokasyon ng iyong na-compile na Qiskit C API library at include directory.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition title=\"Important\" type=\"danger\">\n"
"  The C API links against the Qiskit **C** library, so `QISKIT_LIB` and `QISKIT_INCLUDE` must resolve to it. If unset, the build attempts to infer them from any installed `qiskit` Python package which bundles its C artifacts (`qiskit.capi.get_lib()`/`get_include()`); set them explicitly, as below, to build against a separately compiled Qiskit C API such as the `build/qiskit` clone above.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition title=\"Mahalaga\" type=\"danger\">\n"
"  Nagli-link ang C API sa Qiskit **C** library, kaya dapat tumukoy dito ang `QISKIT_LIB` at `QISKIT_INCLUDE`. Kung hindi naka-set, sinusubukan ng build na hulaan ang mga ito mula sa anumang naka-install na `qiskit` Python package na may kasamang mga C artifact nito (`qiskit.capi.get_lib()`/`get_include()`); itakda ang mga ito nang tahasan, gaya sa ibaba, para mag-build laban sa hiwalay na na-compile na Qiskit C API tulad ng `build/qiskit` clone sa itaas.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition title=\"Hint\" type=\"note\">\n"
"  This code uses the `build/qiskit` path from the code at the top of this page. Adjust the paths according to your setup.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition title=\"Hint\" type=\"note\">\n"
"  Ginagamit ng code na ito ang path na `build/qiskit` mula sa code sa itaas ng pahinang ito. Isaayos ang mga path ayon sa iyong setup.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Tabs group=\"tab\">\n"
"  <TabItem value=\"unix\" label=\"UNIX\">\n"
msgstr ""
"<Tabs group=\"tab\">\n"
"  <TabItem value=\"unix\" label=\"UNIX\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```sh\n"
"    export QISKIT_LIB=$(find $(pwd)/build/qiskit/dist/c/lib -name \"libqiskit.*\")\n"
"    export QISKIT_INCLUDE=$(pwd)/build/qiskit/dist/c/include\n"
"    ```\n"
"  </TabItem>\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  <TabItem value=\"windows\" label=\"Windows\">\n"
msgstr "  <TabItem value=\"windows\" label=\"Windows\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```sh\n"
"    export QISKIT_LIB=$(find $(pwd)/build/qiskit/dist/c/lib -name \"qiskit_cext.dll.lib\")\n"
"    export QISKIT_INCLUDE=$(pwd)/build/qiskit/dist/c/include\n"
"    ```\n"
"  </TabItem>\n"
"</Tabs>\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Now, compile the `qiskit-fermions` C API:\n"
msgstr "Ngayon, i-compile ang C API ng `qiskit-fermions`:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you want to test your installation, you now must also install [CMake](https://cmake.org/). You can then test your compilation by running the C unit tests:\n"
msgstr "Kung gusto mong subukan ang iyong installation, kailangan mo na ring i-install ang [CMake](https://cmake.org/). Pagkatapos ay masusubukan mo ang iyong compilation sa pamamagitan ng pagpapatakbo ng mga C unit test:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Finally, verify that you see these relevant files:\n"
msgstr "Panghuli, tiyaking nakikita mo ang mga kaugnay na file na ito:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`dist/c/lib/libqiskit_fermions.so` (The suffix might vary depending on your operating system)\n"
msgstr "`dist/c/lib/libqiskit_fermions.so` (Maaaring mag-iba ang suffix depende sa iyong operating system)\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`dist/c/include/qiskit_fermions.h`\n"
msgstr "`dist/c/include/qiskit_fermions.h`\n"
